{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8eae6460de1c98cb382c66b0809f0d631c0bd953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x}-8\\cdot 2^x+12=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" /> is satisfied by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b477b7835304026f14df3bef3c7236c5a1184875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } log(3)\\quad \\text{(B) } \\tfrac{1}{2}log(6)\\quad \\text{(C) } 1+log(\\tfrac{3}{2})\\quad \\text{(D) } 1+\\frac{log(3)}{log(2)}\\quad \\text{(E) none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"581\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f8448336c0b16b972b35660312669ede8b62f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x=a$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f7d84b61afe037eb27c303e61271c73c60de08e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x}=(2^x)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" />, the given expression can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/a/c3a563e6aee9f58bb496e90db106f261186c6f13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-8a+12=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />. This can be factored as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa92183d248367da93da61c81f3076c418865af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-6)(a-2)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />, which has solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48e53c204299c9df2aa663422dd532f97ef90364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2^x=6$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/8778d071c05ba3711abafc484e3bcc65b1b4e6b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2^x=2$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />. Looking at the answer choices, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is absent. Rewriting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c646f1fb8cd3982567c7034e785ac7021435cdc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x=6$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/39253a283bf4828a4f0530bdffd245fb1c6c9bff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=log_26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> and then applying the logarithm addition identity in reverse gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b135c6ddce5adf294c359a6304dee69adcf5faa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=log_2(2)+log_2(3)=1+log_2(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"272\" height=\"18\" />. Applying the logarithm division identity shows that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\